Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki's late?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.33,0:00:07.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She said she was going to give me my present today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:10.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe she's late because she\Nstayed up making something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:11.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.07,0:00:12.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:15.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:18.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Worried about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:31.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:33.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.33,0:00:35.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:46.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rubber boot prints?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:58.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're adult-male sized.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:01.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It last snowed two nights ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That means an adult male was here since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.48,0:01:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Five musicians playing the flute and drums...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:24.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Today's a fun Doll Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:10.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I took the next two days off from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:16.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where's Mom? Out shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:21.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, a similar incident\Nhappened the next city over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.87,0:03:25.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The culprit was caught soon afterwards,\Nbut now we have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:31.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know who did this, but we'll have\Nto prevent it from happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:38.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but let me talk to the \Nschool about the media blackout.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:38.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll call you right after I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.89,0:03:41.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it. I'll let the editors know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:43.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:47.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He must be one of Mom's former colleagues,\Na TV Ishikari reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.76,0:03:52.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't want kids\Nremembering an incident like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.51,0:03:56.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is when it started?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:03.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can understand being worried,\Nbut it ain't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.74,0:04:08.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:12.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want Hinazuki to be all alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:14.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you managed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't enough. I could've done more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.64,0:04:23.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to blame yourself\Nfor something after it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:28.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's only so much one person can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.67,0:04:30.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be it you or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go back to school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:35.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll only get depressed being by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:36.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:39.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, let's eat before it gets cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.59,0:04:40.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:45.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something I need to tell all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:50.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What I said about Kayo\Nstaying home with a cold was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:54.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's actually been taken to her\Ngrandmother's place for family reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:57.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was all so sudden that she\Ncouldn't say goodbye to you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.27,0:05:00.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I heard she's doing well in Sapporo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:04.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did she run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:07.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard her mother was beating her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.31,0:05:08.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:10.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But this is good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:14.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:16.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You'll see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:20.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:24.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the Kayo story was something the school\Nand the PTA decided on together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:28.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I ask that you go along with it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:29.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:30.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:34.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It looks like there's a media blackout,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but there's been a police car parked\Nnear Hinazuki's place for the past few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:45.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apparently, her mother's\Nalso a suspect at this stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:51.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And only six days after Hinazuki's disappearance...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:58.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,City Hall has issued an advisory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.74,0:06:02.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are to only leave the school grounds\Naccompanied by a guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:06.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the second victim disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:05.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It happened sooner than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:11.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you hear, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.82,0:06:15.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About Nakanishi Aya from\NIzumi Elementary School?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.80,0:06:21.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A friend who goes there told me she ran away\Nand is now at her grandfather's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:24.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sounds just like Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The running away thing is a lie, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.13,0:06:33.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this a case of serial kidnapping?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:38.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}While there were a few minor differences,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.24,0:06:42.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}history was definitely\Nstarting to repeat itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The investigation was made public,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:52.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but TV Ishikari only ran the story\Nduring the early morning and late evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:58.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and city families with children were\Nadvised to only tune in to TV Ishikari.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:00.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.46,0:07:13.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The police car that was parked\Nall day and night near Hinazuki's place
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:17.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}only showed up every now and then\Nafter Nakanishi Aya's disappearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:21.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The focus of the investigation must\Nhave shifted to "serial kidnappings."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just ten days after her daughter disappeared...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:45.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki's mother threw out a trash bag...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}with a pair of half-knit gloves inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:53.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll give you your present tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:55.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I back in 2006?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,23-1 on Fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:40.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The victim is Fujinuma Sachiko, 52 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:44.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're currently searching for the prime suspect, 29-year-old Fujinuma Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:47.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have an eyewitness testimony. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:48.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:53.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you Fujinuma Satoru-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:54.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.24,0:08:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:00.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:05.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I couldn't save Hinazuki, my mother's \Nbeen murdered, and I'm the prime suspect!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:08.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the reality I'm facing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.62,0:09:11.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to prepare myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.68,0:09:13.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:22.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I could only think of hiding under a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:24.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have no imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:27.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not like it'd be on the news yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:29.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to think first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why was Mom murdered?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:34.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it because\Nshe'd realized who the culprit was?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:38.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was her cell phone in the apartment?\NWhat about her bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.71,0:09:40.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They were both nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.49,0:09:43.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did the culprit take them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:48.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was it because there's a chance\Nshe'd leaked information about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.93,0:09:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:56.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My head feels heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:10:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wish I could get some proper sleep,\Nat least for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:10.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:10.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:13.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:16.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the first time you've gone AWOL.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:18.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Katagiri-kun was worried about you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Knowing you, I'm sure you had a good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:24.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, eat first, talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:25.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:31.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you had a fight with your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:33.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.70,0:10:36.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Old people can be pretty stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.86,0:10:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Feel free to stay as long as you want,\Nbut be sure to make up with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:44.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Want a beer too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:45.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:47.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:49.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go grab some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.60,0:10:56.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was right to think he's an\Nannoying big brother type.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:10:58.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry I lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:03.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After receiving a tip,\Nthe police rushed to the scene
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:07.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and found a woman's body, presumed to be\Nthe mother of the apartment's resident.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:12.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The police are currently searching\Nfor the missing male resident
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:15.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as a person of interest in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:18.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This seriously couldn't get any worse now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.71,0:11:21.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next up, sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.34,0:11:26.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today, the Japanese soccer team left\Nfor Germany for the World Cup finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:29.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How could I be so naïve?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:32.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, I can't hold it against him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:34.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He always tries to do the right thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:36.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course he'd give me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:50.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:55.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Airi...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:59.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the first time you've\Ncalled me Airi, Satoru-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:02.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know you can't leave your phone on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:04.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll track you through GPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:10.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Hop on already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.58,0:12:12.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to run, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry you got dragged into this, Katagiri-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:24.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think you mean Airi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:26.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now we're even in terms of bike rides.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:29.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want me in your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:31.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know what happened, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.11,0:12:35.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The police came to the restaurant today\Nand talked to the manager about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:37.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was on the news too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:39.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:41.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:45.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way you'd kill such a caring mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:49.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:51.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to thank me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're being chased when\Nyou're the one who's hurt the most by this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.58,0:13:00.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trouble seems to follow you around, though, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:05.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:07.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You left this at work the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:10.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I took the liberty of reading\Nthe part you had bookmarked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:13.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It happened in your hometown\Nwhen you were a kid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:16.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Hinazuki Kayo-chan murder case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.48,0:13:19.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she died on\Nthe day of the Doll Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.18,0:13:21.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cried when I read that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.72,0:13:23.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Doll Festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Says it happened on March 3rd.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:30.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, relax for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.80,0:13:34.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to go return the bike to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:37.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't take one step outside this room, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:45.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The book's contents have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.62,0:13:48.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So history can be changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:52.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I can go back there one more time,\NI can still save Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:05.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, right. I slept in Airi's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:06.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To Satoru-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:11.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think I should go about business\Nas usual today, so I'm off to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.29,0:14:16.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My family said they're going out at 10 a.m.,\Nand that they won't be back until after 8 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.74,0:14:21.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can find the house\Nand bike keys next to the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:24.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My mobile number is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.29,0:14:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not Katagiri?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:34.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really don't know how\Nto thank you, Nishizono-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:36.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:39.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your father has always helped me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:42.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, let me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.60,0:14:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My dad is overjoyed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.28,0:14:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's amazed how much one traffic light \Nand crosswalk has increased our foot traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.30,0:14:53.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That just means your father is a smart businessman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:57.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I did was lend him a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:15:01.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, that's a school route.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:04.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We would discuss it often at city council meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.06,0:15:07.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm heading home. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:09.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. Bye, Airi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.84,0:15:11.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:13.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, takeout pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:15.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should've told me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:17.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can treat you once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:22.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's for a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:25.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.53,0:15:26.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-A girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:29.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:35.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's cute, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:41.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! But she's only 17,\Nso she's kind of a child...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:45.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should get going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:49.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.20,0:16:04.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Airi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.96,0:16:06.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:08.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:10.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It comes with\Nthe current promotion, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:12.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, about Satoru-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:19.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine him killing his...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:23.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, doing something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.74,0:16:24.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.89,0:16:29.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you happen to run into him, help him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:30.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:33.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll offer my support as well, so call me if you meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:35.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:45.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can I really close in on the killer by looking this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.60,0:16:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A kidnapping case in the city three years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.10,0:16:54.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do remember something like that happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:17:00.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The suspect was arrested three weeks later,\Nbut he vehemently maintained his innocence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:04.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something feels off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:23.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you calling the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:24.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Airi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.52,0:17:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You told me to help Satoru-san out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:30.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said you would offer your support, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:32.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You've got it all wrong, Airi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:36.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was, uh, just worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:45.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't you just say so from the start?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:48.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to trust you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.26,0:17:52.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I was worried about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.52,0:17:54.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:17:56.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.09,0:17:59.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.11,0:18:03.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you really are worried about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.11,0:18:06.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,please don't call the police to the house\Nof the family that's taking care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.06,0:18:18.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Satoru-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:21.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have nothing to apologize for.\NIf anything, I should thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:25.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I managed to get some rest, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:28.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't go back to that house anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.56,0:18:30.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:34.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which,\Nthat's not your family home, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:37.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. My mother's brother and his wife live there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My family home is out in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.94,0:18:42.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Instead of finding a boarding house\Nso I could go to high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:45.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they told me to come stay\Nwith them here in Chiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.53,0:18:49.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you another question?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.58,0:18:50.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.29,0:18:55.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:19:00.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that I {\i1}can{\i0} trust you.\NI {\i1}want{\i0} to trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:06.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back when I was in grade school,\NI once went shopping with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:13.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The owner caught him trying\Nto leave with chocolate in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:17.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We lived in a small town,\Nand the owner was a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:20.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said he'd forget about it if my father\Nadmitted to stealing it and apologized.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:23.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But my dad adamantly refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.92,0:19:28.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was the first time I heard\Nmy calm and gentle father yell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.70,0:19:32.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The owner was left no\Nchoice but to call the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and my dad was suspended from his post\Nat the local farming co-op for three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:40.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know because I was watching the\Nwhole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:42.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you didn't do it, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.60,0:19:48.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My dad quit the co-op,\Ngot a divorce, and left home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:53.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess my mom thought he actually did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:59.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's for my own sake that I want to trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Similar to someone wanting to be trusted,\Nbut the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:06.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.84,0:20:09.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell the police\NI threatened you into hiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:11.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:14.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can get away by yourself,\Nand I refuse to tell them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you stop asking me if I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:24.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll at least bring you a change of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:31.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The manager didn't call\Nthe police after that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:41.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:44.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:48.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did Satoru-san find his mother's phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.42,0:20:50.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No!\N{\i1}It's from the killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:54.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Stay right where you are."?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:21:00.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A-Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:04.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.88,0:21:06.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
